# Generative AI RAG Pipeline Design with Hybrid Keyword & Embedding Search

Maximize RAG retrieval accuracy by fusing lexical keyword matches with dense semantic vector embeddings using Reciprocal Rank Fusion.

## Why This Architecture Matters in Production
